    "howDerived": "Each Figma paint style was resolved from the fills/strokes of the nodes that reference it (usageCount = number of paints). Styles that no node references cannot be resolved from figma_file.json (the REST /files response does not carry style values); for those the value comes from redesign/design/figma/palette/tokens.json (a Figma style dump made by another fork) and resolvedFrom says so.",
    "lightThemeCoverage": "Only 11 of 24 Light styles are referenced, all inside frame \"Player - Light\" (2425:13624); that frame still uses many Dark styles (e.g. Dark/FG/A2 on control-bar icons, Dark/FG/A1 on library rows). Treat the Light palette as a mapping table, not as a verified design.",
    "issues": [],
    "lightThemeCorrections": "Light fg1, fg2 and fgA4 are corrected per DECISIONS D032 (figmaHex keeps the Figma value). rawColors items carry lightHex/lightAlpha so app-defined colors also follow the theme. Contrast >= 4.5:1 for fg1/fg2/fgA1 on bgB1/bgA1 in both themes is enforced by ThemeContrastTests."
  },
